// Signing settings that belong to the person building, not to the repository.
//
// The simulator and every automated check build unsigned, so nothing here is
// needed for them. Installing on a real iPhone needs a development team: put
// `DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = <your 10-character Team ID>` in Signing.local.xcconfig
// beside this file. That file is ignored by git and survives `xcodegen generate`,
// which regenerates the project from project.yml and would drop a team id typed
// into the project itself. CI passes DEVELOPMENT_TEAM on the command line, which
// overrides both files.
#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
